This project is an independent, unofficial reproduction of one detection path
described in "Dr. DNA: Combating Silent Data Corruptions in Deep Learning
using Distribution of Neuron Activations" (Ma, Lin, Desmaison, Coburn, Moore,
Sankar, Jiao — ASPLOS '24, https://doi.org/10.1145/3620666.3651349). This
license covers this repository's own code only; it is not a license to the
paper itself, and this project is not affiliated with the original authors.
